CoreCLR's VM on witos (plan step R3.1): the layer-2 triple defines __linux__, but the LTTng and user_events providers,
whose generated headers exist for CLR_CMAKE_TARGET_LINUX alone, are not built for witos; the GC's event status takes the
other platforms' branch.
On release/8.0 (plan step N3.2) the change is the same.

